====================================

KASCADE is a derivative work. This file records where the code came from and what
obligations attach to it. It is not a substitute for the licence text in LICENSE.

1. Lineage
----------

    rusty-kaspa            Kaspa developers            ISC
        |
        +-- zkas-rusty     ZKas project                ISC (inherited)
                |
                +-- KASCADE    KASCADE project         ISC (inherited)

The overwhelming majority of the source in this repository originates in
rusty-kaspa. KASCADE's contribution is a set of modifications on top of the
ZKas fork of that codebase.

